nswer/id #uuid "27c64f24-0d09-5df4-90dd-c29025c86c01" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(u+v)({u}^{2}-uv+{v}^{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1ce1dd13-ec96-5dfe-981d-6236a1706a0f" :answer/id #uuid "1ce1dd13-ec96-5dfe-981d-6236a1706a0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(u-v)({u}^{2}+uv+{v}^{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f8156035-22f3-5439-a0eb-57914f4ac72b" :answer/id #uuid "f8156035-22f3-5439-a0eb-57914f4ac72b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(u-v)({u}^{2}-2uv-{v}^{2})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-efa83c70-ebda-58c7-9dc4-66acbcb8874b" :question/id #uuid "efa83c70-ebda-58c7-9dc4-66acbcb8874b" :question/math-academy-id "q-112333" :question/problem "Factor $\\frac{8}{{w}^{3}}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{9}}.$" :question/worked-solution "The difference of cubes formula is given by\n\n$$\n{a}^{3}-{b}^{3}=(a-b)({a}^{2}+ab+{b}^{2}).\n$$\n\nNotice that we can write our expression as a difference of cubes, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{8}{{w}^{3}}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{9}}={(\\frac{2}{w})}^{3}-{(\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})}^{3}\n$$\n\nNow, we factor our expression using the difference of cubes formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{8}{{w}^{3}}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{9}} & ={(\\frac{2}{w})}^{3}-{(\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})}^{3} \\\\  & =(\\frac{2}{w}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})({(\\frac{2}{w})}^{2}+\\frac{2}{w}\\cdot \\frac{1}{{z}^{3}}+{(\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})}^{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{2}{w}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})(\\frac{4}{{w}^{2}}+\\frac{2}{w{z}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{({z}^{3})^{2}}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{2}{w}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})(\\frac{4}{{w}^{2}}+\\frac{2}{w{z}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{{z}^{6}})\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c8a54896-3654-52b8-b0f1-96c46cbcf220"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c8a54896-3654-52b8-b0f1-96c46cbcf220" :answer-field/id #uuid "c8a54896-3654-52b8-b0f1-96c46cbcf220" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8121d101-b037-5fe7-a7e1-a87bb7b493b2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-7bd1b9a5-c274-5960-8128-6e38205fa037" "answer-1f2f5fad-489c-5ef2-abc8-2ead566193c8" "answer-76707eb8-870b-5c30-8e98-237eddb6e483" "answer-080f383a-cad7-506e-98f6-a6105a463e73" "answer-8121d101-b037-5fe7-a7e1-a87bb7b493b2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7bd1b9a5-c274-5960-8128-6e38205fa037" :answer/id #uuid "7bd1b9a5-c274-5960-8128-6e38205fa037" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{1}{w}+\\frac{2}{{z}^{3}})(\\frac{1}{{w}^{2}}-\\frac{2}{w{z}^{3}}+\\frac{4}{{z}^{6}})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1f2f5fad-489c-5ef2-abc8-2ead566193c8" :answer/id #uuid "1f2f5fad-489c-5ef2-abc8-2ead566193c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{1}{w}-\\frac{2}{z})(\\frac{1}{{w}^{2}}+\\frac{2}{wz}+\\frac{4}{{z}^{2}})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-76707eb8-870b-5c30-8e98-237eddb6e483" :answer/id #uuid "76707eb8-870b-5c30-8e98-237eddb6e483" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{2}{w}+\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})(\\frac{4}{{w}^{2}}-\\frac{2}{w{z}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{{z}^{6}})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-080f383a-cad7-506e-98f6-a6105a463e73" :answer/id #uuid "080f383a-cad7-506e-98f6-a6105a463e73" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{2}{w}-\\frac{1}{z})(\\frac{4}{{w}^{2}}-\\frac{2}{wz}+\\frac{1}{{z}^{2}})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8121d101-b037-5fe7-a7e1-a87bb7b493b2" :answer/id #uuid "8121d101-b037-5fe7-a7e1-a87bb7b493b2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{2}{w}-\\frac{1}{{z}^{3}})(\\frac{4}{{w}^{2}}+\\frac{2}{w{z}^{3}}+\\frac{1}{{z}^{6}})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-ee3cc387-c8ba-5e21-b6bf-54f77512a2c2" :question/id #uuid "ee3cc387-c8ba-5e21-b6bf-54f77512a2c2" :question/math-academy-id "q-112336" :question/problem "Factor $\\frac{{u}^{3}}{8}-1.$" :question/worked-solution "The difference of cubes formula is given by\n\n$$\n{a}^{3}-{b}^{3}=(a-b)({a}^{2}+ab+{b}^{2}).\n$$\n\nNotice that we can write our expression as a difference of cubes, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{u}^{3}}{8}-1={(\\frac{u}{2})}^{3}-{1}^{3}\n$$\n\nNow, we factor our expression using the difference of cubes formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{u}^{3}}{8}-1 & ={(\\frac{u}{2})}^{3}-{1}^{3} \\\\  & =(\\frac{u}{2}-1)({(\\frac{u}{2})}^{2}+\\frac{u}{2}\\cdot 1+{(1)}^{2}) \\\\  & =(\\frac{u}{2}-1)(\\frac{{u}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{u}{2}+1)\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-7bf69bfe-f49c-586d-9712-8dbc31ce7c96"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-7bf69bfe-f49c-586d-9712-8dbc31ce7c96" :answer-field/id #uuid "7bf69bfe-f49c-586d-9712-8dbc31ce7c96" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-74bc0359-d645-51ed-8e8a-283c5a90cded" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3386a987-4784-5171-a2e1-094255e1eb0c" "answer-7d464a43-e7cc-5052-8183-f2ac55c0f667" "answer-74bc0359-d645-51ed-8e8a-283c5a90cded" "answer-4982dc80-f4cf-5d3a-be46-4ba2743eda41" "answer-1e1dd07c-e585-5339-8d34-c067ab9d0124"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3386a987-4784-5171-a2e1-094255e1eb0c" :answer/id #uuid "3386a987-4784-5171-a2e1-094255e1eb0c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{u}{2}+1)(\\frac{{u}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{u}{2}+1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7d464a43-e7cc-5052-8183-f2ac55c0f667" :answer/id #uuid "7d464a43-e7cc-5052-8183-f2ac55c0f667" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{u}{2}-1)(\\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+u+1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-74bc0359-d645-51ed-8e8a-283c5a90cded" :answer/id #uuid "74bc0359-d645-51ed-8e8a-283c5a90cded" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{u}{2}-1)(\\frac{{u}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{u}{2}+1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4982dc80-f4cf-5d3a-be46-4ba2743eda41" :answer/id #uuid "4982dc80-f4cf-5d3a-be46-4ba2743eda41" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{u}{4}+1)(\\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}-u+1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1e1dd07c-e585-5339-8d34-c067ab9d0124" :answer/id #uuid "1e1dd07c-e585-5339-8d34-c067ab9d0124" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{u}{4}-1)(\\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}+u+1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186069967 :tutorial/content "A polynomial of the form $a^3 + b^3$ is called a **sum of cubes**, while a polynomial of the form $a^3 – b^3$ is called a **difference of cubes**. \n\nBoth of these polynomials follow a similar factor pattern:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}^{3}+{b}^{3} & =(a+b)({a}^{2}-ab+{b}^{2}) \\\\ {a}^{3}-{b}^{3} & =(a-b)({a}^{2}+ab+{b}^{2})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nOne trick to memorizing the signs in these patterns is to use the mnemonic **SOAP**, which stands for **S**ame, **O**pposite, **A**lways **P**ositive.\n\n- The sign of the linear factor is the **S**ame as that of the original polynomial,\n\n- the first sign of the quadratic factor is the **O**pposite sign, and\n\n- the last sign of the quadratic factor is **A**lways **P**ositive." :db/ensure [:tutorial/validate]} {:db/id 17592186069923 :tutorial/content "To verify the identity \n\n$$\na^3 + b^3 = (a + b)(a^2 - ab + b^2)\n$$\n\nwe begin by expanding the right-hand side:\n\n$$\n(a + b)(a^2 - ab + b^2) = a(a^2 - ab + b^2) + b(a^2 - ab + b^2)\n$$\n\nNow, we apply the distributive law to each term:\n\n- For the first term, we have\n\n$$\na(a^2 - ab + b^2) = a^3 - a^2b + ab^2.\n$$\n\n- For the second term, we have\n\n$$\nb(a^2 - ab + b^2) = a^2b - ab^2 + b^3.\n$$\n\nAdding both expressions gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(a+b)({a}^{2}-ab+{b}^{2}) & ={a}^{3}-{a}^{2}b+a{b}^{2}+{a}^{2}b-a{b}^{2}+{b}^{3} \\\\  & ={a}^{3}-\\cancel{{a}^{2}b}+a{b}^{2}+\\cancel{{a}^{2}b}-a{b}^{2}+{b}^{3} \\\\  & ={a}^{3}+a{b}^{2}-a{b}^{2}+{b}^{3} \\\\  & ={a}^{3}+\\cancel{a{b}^{2}}-\\cancel{a{b}^{2}}+{b}^{3} \\\\  & ={a}^{3}+{b}^{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nas required.\n\nWe can verify the formula for the difference in cubes, i.e. \n\n$$\na^3 - b^3 = (a - b)(a^2 + ab + b^2)\n$$\n\nin a similar way." :db/ensure [:tutorial/validate]} {:db/id 17592186068970 :activity/expected-seconds 660.0 :db/ensure [:activity/validate]}]
